  ⟨ewClosureRatio_as_rung, seesawRatio_as_rung, planckClosureRatio_as_rung,
   planckMassRatio_as_rung, newtonScaleProduct_as_rung, qcdClosureRatio_eq,
   fun m => scaleTowerRung_sq 9 m,
   criticalEigenvalue_mul_rungExponent 9 (by norm_num)⟩

/-! ## NON-VACUITY (W8): the multiplicity lattice and the eigenvalue reciprocal are load-bearing. -/

